## CGR hint contacts for Node 1 only.
## Tells Node 1's CGR that Node 2 can reach Node 3, so the bundle is
## forwarded to Node 2.  Node 2 has no route to Node 3 and immediately
## abandons with SrNoKnownRoute, sending a deletion CRS back to Node 1.

a range +0 +600 2 3 1
a range +0 +600 3 2 1

a contact +0 +600 2 3 100000
a contact +0 +600 3 2 100000
